<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Total prices at $9, in range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Total prices at $9, in range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	Total Entertainment Restaurant Corp</p>
<p>   Priced At					  $9</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	   $8.50 - $9.50</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			2,100,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	Montgomery Securities</p>
<p>NOTE: Terms were modified for the planned initial public offering in Total Entertainment Restaurant Corp. The proposed number of shares was raised to 2.1 million from two million shares originally. The estimated price range was lowered to $8.50 to $9.50 per share from between $9 and $11 a share initially.</p>
</text>
